{
  "id": "text-of",
  "title": {
    "tr": "Kendi stringify'ımız",
    "en": "Our Own stringify"
  },
  "difficulty": 1,
  "language": "rust",
  "prompt": {
    "tr": "prompt.tr.md",
    "en": "prompt.en.md"
  },
  "entry": "src/main.rs",
  "files": [
    {
      "name": "my_macros/src/lib.rs",
      "starter": "starter-my_macros-src-lib.{lang}.rs",
      "solution": "solution-my_macros-src-lib.rs"
    },
    {
      "name": "Cargo.toml",
      "readonly": true
    },
    {
      "name": "my_macros/Cargo.toml",
      "readonly": true
    },
    {
      "name": "src/main.rs",
      "readonly": true
    }
  ],
  "timeout_sec": 45,
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "`format!(\"{:?}\", input.to_string()).parse().unwrap()`",
      "en": "`format!(\"{:?}\", input.to_string()).parse().unwrap()`"
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n**my_macros/src/lib.rs**\n\n```rust\nuse proc_macro::TokenStream;\n\n#[proc_macro]\npub fn text_of(input: TokenStream) -> TokenStream {\n    format!(\"{:?}\", input.to_string()).parse().unwrap()\n}\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n**my_macros/src/lib.rs**\n\n```rust\nuse proc_macro::TokenStream;\n\n#[proc_macro]\npub fn text_of(input: TokenStream) -> TokenStream {\n    format!(\"{:?}\", input.to_string()).parse().unwrap()\n}\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "stdout",
      "match": "trimmed_lines",
      "expected": "hello\na + 1\nVec<u8>"
    },
    {
      "type": "rust_require",
      "pattern": "#\\[proc_macro\\]",
      "show": "#[proc_macro]",
      "file": "my_macros/src/lib.rs"
    },
    {
      "type": "rust_require",
      "pattern": "stringify|to_string",
      "show": "to_string",
      "file": "my_macros/src/lib.rs"
    }
  ]
}
